# Keep the build context lean AND correct: host node_modules must never be
# copied into images. The api image's `npm install` creates a SYMLINK at
# /app/api/node_modules/@unm/plugin-sdk (file: dep); if the host's real
# directory were also copied over it, BuildKit fails with
# "cannot copy to non-directory". Same for every plugin image.
# NOTE: BuildKit uses filepath.Match (no globstar) — list depths explicitly.
node_modules
*/node_modules
plugins/*/node_modules

.git
dist
*.log
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
coverage
.vite
